13. DIRECT UPLOAD MODEL
Large files should not pass unnecessarily through the OneDraft API service.
The preferred workflow is:
CLIENT
 ↓
REQUEST UPLOAD
 ↓
ARTIFACT SERVICE
 ↓
SIGNED UPLOAD URL
 ↓
OBJECT STORAGE
 ↓
UPLOAD COMPLETE
 ↓
ARTIFACT SERVICE
 ↓
HASH VERIFICATION
 ↓
ARTIFACT VERSION
This prevents the API layer from becoming a large-file transport bottleneck.

