79. FAILURE RECOVERY
The artifact subsystem shall tolerate failures including:
interrupted upload
worker failure
object storage timeout
database timeout
hash mismatch
conversion failure
security scan failure
package generation failure
temporary storage outage
The system shall preserve enough state to retry safely.

80. IDEMPOTENCY
Mutating artifact operations shall support:
Idempotency-Key
Repeated requests must not create duplicate artifact versions when the same logical operation has already completed.

81. CONCURRENCY CONTROL
Artifact version creation shall use transactional concurrency protection.
The system must prevent two concurrent writers from incorrectly assigning the same:
artifact.version_number
Optimistic concurrency should be preferred where appropriate.

